#: colorscm.cpp:119
msgid ""
"This is a preview of the color settings which will be applied if you click "
"\"Apply\" or \"OK\". You can click on different parts of this preview image. "
"The widget name in the \"Widget color\" box will change to reflect the part "
"of the preview image you clicked."
msgstr ""

#: colorscm.cpp:131
msgid "Color Scheme"
msgstr "Klöörschema"

#: colorscm.cpp:140
msgid ""
"This is a list of predefined color schemes, including any that you may have "
"created. You can preview an existing color scheme by selecting it from the "
"list. The current scheme will be replaced by the selected color scheme."
"<p> Warning: if you have not yet applied any changes you may have made to "
"the current scheme, those changes will be lost if you select another color "
"scheme."
msgstr ""

#: colorscm.cpp:148
msgid "&Save Scheme..."
msgstr "Schema &sekern..."

#: colorscm.cpp:151
msgid ""
"Press this button if you want to save the current color settings as a color "
"scheme. You will be prompted for a name."
msgstr ""

#: colorscm.cpp:155
msgid "R&emove Scheme"
msgstr "Schema &wegdoon"

#: colorscm.cpp:159
msgid ""
"Press this button to remove the selected color scheme. Note that this button "
"is disabled if you do not have permission to delete the color scheme."
msgstr ""

#: colorscm.cpp:163
msgid "I&mport Scheme..."
msgstr "Schema &importeert..."

#: colorscm.cpp:166
msgid ""
"Press this button to import a new color scheme. Note that the color scheme "
"will only be available for the current user."
